{"id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion.md","title":"Chomsky Normal-Form Theorem","display":"thm-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal-Form Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","aliases":["73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","73-thm-chomsky-normal-form"],"display":"thm-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal-Form Theorem","depends_on":["[[73-df-standard-cnf]]","[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; local fresh-start epsilon extension","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</span><span>73-thm-chomsky-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-chomsky-normal-form — Chomsky Normal-Form Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" href=\"?note=7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" title=\"73-df-standard-cnf\">73-df-standard-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; local fresh-start epsilon extension"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (grammars in Chomsky normal form, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" href=\"?note=7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" title=\"73-df-standard-cnf\">73-df-standard-cnf</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add a fresh start symbol, eliminate epsilon productions except the permitted start production, eliminate unit and useless productions, then binarize long right sides and isolate terminals.</li>\n<li>Each stage preserves the generated language; the fresh start symbol never occurs on a right-hand side, so the empty-word case satisfies the local CNF definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-standard-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；字母与有限词的类型见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free languages, see [[73-df-cfg-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-standard-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}$ (grammars in Chomsky normal form, see [[73-df-standard-cnf]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}chomsky\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CNF}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))","display":true}],"bytes":1896,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion|Chomsky Normal-Form Theorem]]"},{"id":"90e260b881deee8a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-language-class]]，$\\operatorname{CNF}_0$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]；允许开始符号空词例外的转换见 [[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]。"},{"id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"248908af8dc82492","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7fc5fa30c0841ef9","83639a9615c06195","0a6da8c909717780"]}